<title>USA: Value Property to explore strategic options.</title>
<headline>Value Property to explore strategic options.</headline>
<dateline>NEW BRUNSWICK, N.J. 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Value Property Trust said Monday it has hired Merrill Lynch &amp; Co as its financial adviser as it explores strategic options, including possible business combinations or bulk sales of assets.</p>
<p>Value Property, a self-administered real estate investment trust, said Merrill Lynch will advise the company's board on its options.</p>
